You may view and play the games, and you may copy or fork this repository to run
the games for yourself, for personal, non-commercial purposes only. Any other use
of the Artwork needs prior written permission, including commercial use, selling,
including it in other products, or redistributing it separately from these games.

Third-party works shown in the Artwork:

